model {
  extend basalt.modelGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Manager-authorized usage series retain every source and append-only request identity. Optional Zurich daily buckets follow actual local calendar boundaries, including daylight-saving changes, while existing reads stay UTC. Historical usage forecasts use four complete weeks and the same estimator for held-out misses. Incomplete native capture cannot become observed zero-use days; current cursor coverage distinguishes idle reads from a stalled forward scan. Forecasts over known token or price subsets name their exclusions and remain Low confidence. Hidden values stay unknown, while authorized refusal counts include counts-only rows. Usage history never establishes remaining provider quota or routing capacity."
    }
  }
}
